. * ============================================================================
. * Under num_place==1 (reduced_form/restrict_samp), author FE is a strict
. * refinement of inst FE, so an additive twfe(author, inst) is not identified.
. * Instead: fit the actual main spec with athr_id + year FE, save author FEs,
. * aggregate by inst -> mean author FE per inst = "average PI level at inst".
. * Then plot + regress on all HERD/IC vars.
. * ============================================================================
. 
. use ../external/prepped_samples/es_all_jrnls_r1_r2.dta, clear

. 
. * Reconstruct Z_it and Z_share_it exactly as the main pooled_did spec builds them.
. cap drop post Z_it Z_share_it

. gen post       = year >= 2014

. gen Z_it       = exposure      * post

. gen Z_share_it = mkt_spend_shr * post

. 
. * Main spec fit: ppmlhdfe ppr_cnt Z_it Z_share_it, absorb(athr_id year)
. * `savefe' writes __hdfe1__=athr_FE, __hdfe2__=yr_FE on log(E[Y]) scale.
. ppmlhdfe ppr_cnt Z_it Z_share_it, absorb(athr_FE=athr_id yr_FE=year) vce(cluster athr_id)
