. * -------------------------------------------------------- (1) inst-level object
. * Mean athr_FE by inst = "average PI level" at each inst on log(ppr_cnt) scale.
. * Also record N_PIs per inst (weight) and within-inst SD (spread).
. bys inst_id: gegen inst_mean_FE = mean(athr_FE)

. bys inst_id: gegen inst_sd_FE   = sd(athr_FE)

. bys inst_id: gen  N_pi          = _N

. 
. keep inst_id public type inst_mean_FE inst_sd_FE N_pi

. duplicates drop inst_id, force

Duplicates in terms of inst_id

(10,191 observations deleted)

. 
